"fum_370_iq6_AAAAAA","label":"師沖〔楊侃長子，北史作師仲〕","status":"ai_provisional","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"師沖","mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0363"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011","mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0363","quote":"師沖"}],"identity_note":"長子師沖祕書郎；北史同濟河事件師仲保同角色異文，不另造兩子、不校改正文。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011","quote":"及車駕南還，顥令蕭衍將陳慶之守北中城，自據南岸。有夏州義士為顥守河中渚，乃密信通款，求破橋立效，尒朱榮率軍赴之。及橋破，應接不果，皆為顥所屠滅。榮因悵然，將為還計，欲更圖後舉。侃曰：「未審明大王發并州之日，已知有夏州義士指來相應，為欲廣申經略，寧復帝基乎？夫兵散而更合，瘡愈而更戰，持此收功，自古不少，豈可以一圖不全，而眾慮頓廢。今事不果，乃是兩賊相殺，則大王之利矣。若今即還，民情失望，去就之心，何由可保？未若召發民材，惟多縛筏，間以舟楫，沿河廣布，令數百里中，皆為渡勢。首尾既遠，顥復知防何處，一旦得渡，必立大功。」榮大笑曰：「黃門即奏行此計。」於是尒朱兆與侃等遂與馬渚諸楊南渡，破顥子領軍將軍冠受，擒之。顥便南走。車駕入都，侃解尚書，正黃門，加征東將軍、金紫光祿大夫。以濟河之功，進爵濟北郡開國公，增邑五百戶，復除其長子師沖為祕書郎。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0363","object_person_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0088","source_term":"其長子師沖"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-weishu058-yang-011","interpretation_note":"僅明近系直接父親，ID後綴非排行；未知婚配不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011:m0363"],"paragraph_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p011"],"table_cell_ids"